WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Teens checkoff : focused gameplay demonstrations

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Start game

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.833
Mushroom: Small Mario to Big Mario

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:06.167
Fire Flower: Big Mario to Fire Mario

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:07.567
Z fires in Mario's facing direction; maximum 3 fireballs

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:10.567
Fireballs disappear after 2.5 seconds

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:12.900
Star: timed invincibility; Fire Mario form stays active

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.500
Star contact defeats a Goomba and keeps Mario safe

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.833
The star buff expires; Mario keeps the Fire form

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:24.367
Enemy side hit: Fire to Small, with brief damage protection

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:26.033
After protection expires, another side hit causes death

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:27.033
Restart resets Mario, buffs, boxes, enemies, score and music

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:27.800
A stomp earns a point before entering the next world

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.133
World 1-2: score carries over through shared ScriptableObject data

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:30.300
Restart also works independently in World 1-2

